{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"authoring","lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"串联电路中的电流与断路","goals":["结合电路图识别串联电路的唯一电流路径","理解两只串联灯泡中的电流相同","理解任意一处断路会使全回路没有电流"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["先结合上传的电路图追踪电流路径，再用电荷守恒解释电流关系","通过完整回路与断路情形的对照呈现结果"],"context_refs":["learner_request","session_context.assets.asset-circuit-001"]}},"steps":[{"key":"inspect-circuit","purpose":"结合上传的图片识别串联电路的组成和连接方式。","beats":[{"key":"show-circuit","say":"先看你上传的串联电路图：电池提供电能，两只灯泡A、B和导线依次连成一个完整回路。","delivery":"neutral","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"circuit-image","kind":"image","role":"串联电路示意图","content":{"asset_id":"asset-circuit-001","alt":"电池、开关和两只灯泡组成的串联电路","regions":[{"as":"battery","source_region":"asset-circuit-001#battery"},{"as":"lamp-a","source_region":"asset-circuit-001#lamp-a"},{"as":"lamp-b","source_region":"asset-circuit-001#lamp-b"},{"as":"wire","source_region":"asset-circuit-001#wire"}]},"place":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"main-visual","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"point","when":"during_speech","target":"circuit-image#battery"},{"do":"point","when":"during_speech","target":"circuit-image#lamp-a"},{"do":"point","when":"during_speech","target":"circuit-image#lamp-b"},{"do":"point","when":"during_speech","target":"circuit-image#wire"}]},{"key":"identify-path","say":"沿导线回路追踪可以看到：电流从电池出发，依次经过灯泡A和灯泡B，再回到电池。中间没有分支，所以串联电路只有一条电流路径。","delivery":"emphatic","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"single-path","kind":"diagram","role":"唯一电流路径","content":{"sequence":["电池","灯泡A","灯泡B","返回电池"],"statement":"串联电路只有一条路径，没有分支"},"place":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"circuit-image","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"single-path","emphasis":"突出唯一的一条闭合路径"}]}]},{"key":"explain-current","purpose":"从唯一路径和电荷守恒解释两只灯泡电流相同。","beats":[{"key":"mark-currents","say":"把通过灯泡A的电流记作I₁，把通过灯泡B的电流记作I₂。它们都位于刚才那条唯一的电流路径上。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"current-a","kind":"math","role":"灯泡A的电流","content":{"expression":"I₁","meaning":"通过灯泡A的电流"},"place":{"relation":"near","anchor":"circuit-image","align":"start","gap":"compact"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"current-b","kind":"math","role":"灯泡B的电流","content":{"expression":"I₂","meaning":"通过灯泡B的电流"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"current-a","align":"start","gap":"compact"}},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"a-on-path","from":"current-a","to":"single-path","relation":"位于唯一路径上","label":"灯泡A处"},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"b-on-path","from":"current-b","to":"single-path","relation":"位于唯一路径上","label":"灯泡B处"}]},{"key":"conserve-charge","say":"电流表示单位时间内通过某处的电荷量。因为回路没有分支，电荷不能在两只灯泡之间凭空增加、消失或持续堆积；单位时间内通过灯泡A的电荷量，也必须通过灯泡B。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"charge-rule","kind":"note","role":"电荷守恒解释","content":{"definition":"电流表示单位时间内通过某处的电荷量","reason":"唯一路径上电荷不凭空增加、消失或持续堆积","consequence":"单位时间内通过灯泡A和灯泡B的电荷量相同"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"single-path","align":"start","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"focus","when":"after_speech","targets":["single-path","charge-rule"],"intent":"联系唯一路径与电荷守恒"}]},{"key":"state-equality","say":"因此，在这个串联电路正常闭合时，两只灯泡中的电流相同，结论是I₁=I₂。灯泡不会把一部分电流“用掉”；它转换的是电能，而电荷仍沿同一条路径继续运动。","delivery":"emphatic","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"equal-current","kind":"math","role":"串联电流关系","content":{"expression":"I₁=I₂","condition":"回路完整且闭合","explanation":"两只灯泡位于同一条无分支路径上"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"charge-rule","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"energy-note","kind":"note","role":"澄清常见误解","content":{"statement":"灯泡转换电能，但不会把电流用掉"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"equal-current","align":"center","gap":"compact"}},{"do":"connect","when":"after_speech","as":"rule-to-equality","from":"charge-rule","to":"equal-current","relation":"推出","label":"电荷守恒"},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"equal-current","emphasis":"突出I₁=I₂"}]}]},{"key":"explain-open-circuit","purpose":"说明任意一只灯泡处断路对整个串联回路的影响。","beats":[{"key":"introduce-break","say":"现在设想灯泡A损坏并形成断路。断路就是原来连续的导电路径在这一处被切断，电路不再构成完整闭合回路。","delivery":"careful","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"open-at-a","kind":"diagram","role":"灯泡A处断路","content":{"scenario":"灯泡A损坏","state":"灯泡A处断路","effect_on_path":"唯一导电路径被切断，回路不再闭合"},"place":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"open-circuit-comparison","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"breaks-path","from":"open-at-a","to":"single-path","relation":"切断","label":"断路"},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"breaks-path","emphasis":"突出唯一路径被切断"}]},{"key":"whole-circuit-zero","say":"由于串联电路没有第二条路可绕行，灯泡A处一旦断路，电荷就不能沿回路持续运动，于是全回路电流都变为零，两只灯泡都会熄灭。","delivery":"emphatic","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"zero-current","kind":"math","role":"断路后的电流","content":{"expression":"I₁=I₂=0","cause":"唯一电流路径被断路切断","result":"两只灯泡都熄灭"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"open-at-a","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"connect","when":"during_speech","as":"break-to-zero","from":"open-at-a","to":"zero-current","relation":"导致","label":"全回路无电流"},{"do":"emphasize","when":"after_speech","target":"zero-current","emphasis":"突出I₁=I₂=0和两灯都熄灭"}]},{"key":"generalize-break","say":"同理，若断路发生在灯泡B、开关或任意一段导线上，结果都一样：只要串联回路任一处断开，唯一路径就不完整，全回路无电流。","delivery":"encouraging","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"open-rule","kind":"note","role":"串联断路规律","content":{"rule":"任一处断路，全回路无电流","possible_locations":["灯泡A","灯泡B","开关","任意一段导线"],"reason":"串联电路只有一条路径"},"place":{"relation":"below","anchor":"zero-current","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"group","when":"after_speech","as":"open-circuit-result","role":"断路因果链","label":"任一处断路 → 唯一路径被切断 → 全回路无电流","members":["open-at-a","zero-current","open-rule"]},{"do":"focus","when":"after_speech","targets":["open-circuit-result","break-to-zero"],"intent":"完整呈现串联电路断路的因果结果"}]}]},{"key":"consolidate","purpose":"把正常闭合与断路两种状态归纳为清晰的对照。","beats":[{"key":"compare-states","say":"把两种状态放在一起看：回路完整时，唯一路径处处连续，所以I₁=I₂；任一处断路时，唯一的路径被切断，所以I₁=I₂=0，两只灯泡都熄灭。 讲到这里先停下，请你回答为什么两灯电流相同；你回答后我再继续。","delivery":"encouraging","actions":[{"do":"write","when":"during_speech","as":"state-comparison","kind":"table","role":"完整回路与断路对照","content":{"columns":["电路状态","路径状态","电流","灯泡结果"],"rows":[["完整闭合","唯一的路径连续","I₁=I₂","两灯中都有电流"],["任一处断路","唯一的路径被切断","I₁=I₂=0","两灯都熄灭"]]},"place":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"lesson-conclusion","align":"center","gap":"normal"}},{"do":"group","when":"after_speech","as":"core-ideas","role":"课程核心结论","label":"串联电路的路径、电流与断路","members":["single-path","equal-current","open-circuit-result","state-comparison"]},{"do":"focus","when":"after_speech","targets":["core-ideas"],"intent":"聚焦完整回路和断路状态的核心规律"}]}]}],"close":{"summary":"串联电路只有一条无分支的电流路径。根据电荷守恒，完整闭合时通过两只灯泡的电流相同，即I₁=I₂；任一只灯泡或回路中的任一处发生断路，唯一的路径都会被切断，因此全回路无电流，I₁=I₂=0，两只灯泡都熄灭。","focus":["core-ideas","equal-current","open-circuit-result","state-comparison"]}}
